[
    {
        "content": "<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Dvd1</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">d</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">n</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">instance</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">d</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Dvd1</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">d</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">⟨⟩</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">instance</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">d</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">n</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">Dvd1</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">d</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">n</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Dvd1</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">d</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">n</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">d</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">⟨⟩</span>\n\n<span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"n\">synth</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Dvd1</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"c1\">-- failed to synthesize ...</span>\n</code></pre></div>",
        "id": 577332167,
        "sender_full_name": "overvoid13",
        "timestamp": 1772650436
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>I don't know the exact reason for failure, but I won't be surprised if the answer is \"class synthesis is not supposed to be used as an auto theorem prover like this\"</p>",
        "id": 577333273,
        "sender_full_name": "Weiyi Wang",
        "timestamp": 1772650810
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>The issue seems to be that lean doesn't want to unify 4 with <code>?_+2</code>... I don't think lean will ever have this feature though...</p>",
        "id": 577335769,
        "sender_full_name": "Edward van de Meent",
        "timestamp": 1772651601
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>But how can I implement a typeclass like that? For example, if I fix the d, it will work well.</p>",
        "id": 577336060,
        "sender_full_name": "overvoid13",
        "timestamp": 1772651700
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>The idea is that you do not want to implement a typeclass like that</p>",
        "id": 577336099,
        "sender_full_name": "Violeta Hernández",
        "timestamp": 1772651712
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>We already have tactics like <code>norm_num</code> or <code>simp</code> that can solve these sorts of problems automatically</p>",
        "id": 577336217,
        "sender_full_name": "Violeta Hernández",
        "timestamp": 1772651754
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>and in the rare scenario where you need this hypothesis in some situation where you also want typeclass inference, you should use <a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/find/?pattern=Fact#doc\">docs#Fact</a></p>",
        "id": 577336292,
        "sender_full_name": "Violeta Hernández",
        "timestamp": 1772651775
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Even if you needed it as a type class, don't be so inefficient! Here's a better one:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Mathlib</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Logic</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Basic</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">BoolTrue</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Bool</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">where</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">out</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">true</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">instance</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">BoolTrue</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">no_index</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">true</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">⟨</span><span class=\"n\">rfl</span><span class=\"bp\">⟩</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">instance</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">d</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">n</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">BoolTrue</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">((</span><span class=\"n\">n</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">mod</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">d</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">beq</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">zero</span><span class=\"o\">)]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Fact</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">d</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∣</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">n</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">constructor</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">obtain</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">⟨</span><span class=\"n\">h</span><span class=\"bp\">⟩</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">‹_›</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">simpa</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">dvd_iff_mod_eq_zero</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">using</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">h</span>\n\n<span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"n\">synth</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Fact</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">231491374813</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∣</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">5420003164434566769</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n</code></pre></div>",
        "id": 577377851,
        "sender_full_name": "Robin Arnez",
        "timestamp": 1772667716
    },
